## 🚀 ROADMAP 2026

* **Q1 2026:** Multi-camera pipeline synchronization and calibration for 8x USB 3.0 feeds.
* **Q2 2026:** Migration to YOLOv11 and Hailo-8L optimization for industrial component detection.
* **Q3 2026:** Real-time 3D reconstruction from stereo vision nodes and safety zone dynamic mapping.
* **Q4 2026:** Support for 9-DOF visual tracking (including orientation redundancy) and sub-micrometric correction.

